Cell["\<\
In this notebook, we present a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Manipulate\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] demonstration of orbits around a Schwarzschild black \
hole. The demonstration lets us explore the parameter space of a test \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]star\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] orbiting a black hole, \
at-will constructing stable orbits with relativistic precession or crashing \
the star into the event horizon, never to return. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
