  "8e358f70-abee-436b-8076-e0df0a311810"],
 StyleBox["Property menu, call ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["Quit", "Input"],
 StyleBox[" once, then comment out the ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 StyleBox["Quit", "Input"],
 StyleBox[" cell, or mark it unevaluatable again. Alternatively, you can quit \
the kernel via the Evaluation menu (last item). At that point, you can \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Evaluate Notebook\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] in a clean \
environment. Otherwise, you can evaluate cells in this notebook individually.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Item",
