Cell["Extreme effects of relativity are on display as precession. ", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.977866996844562*^9, 3.977867029450664*^9}, {
   3.977871060872889*^9, 3.977871135951161*^9}, {3.977871206515233*^9, 
